---
flowchart LR
  accTitle: bevy_light::SpotLight · 对象关系
  accDescr: 当前对象及全部直接关联对象。
  %% n*/e* 是业务节点/关系，sc* 是阶段关系；layout_* 仅用于排版。
  classDef node_system fill:#EFF3F8,stroke:#3567A6,stroke-width:1.6px,color:#1F3340
  classDef node_component fill:#F1F5F2,stroke:#4B8060,stroke-width:1.6px,color:#1F3340
  classDef edge_read stroke:#3567A6,stroke-width:1.6px,stroke-dasharray:6 4
  classDef edge_reference stroke:#7B4DB2,stroke-width:1.5px,stroke-dasharray:6 4
  classDef external_node stroke-dasharray:6 4
  n0@{ shape: rounded, label: "**SpotLight**<br/>配置沿指定方向照射的聚光灯。" }
  class n0 node_component
  n1@{ shape: rounded, label: "**assign​_​objects​_​to​_​clusters**<br/>将灯光、探针及贴花分配到视图分簇。" }
  class n1 node_system
  n2@{ shape: rounded, label: "**update​_​spot​_​light​_​bounding​_​spheres**<br/>按聚光灯位置和范围更新剔除包围球。" }
  class n2 node_system
  n3@{ shape: rounded, label: "**draw​_​lights**<br/>为显式标记的各类光源绘制调试轮廓。" }
  class n3 node_system
  n4@{ shape: rounded, label: "**draw​_​all​_​lights**<br/>按配置颜色模式绘制全部灯光调试图形。" }
  class n4 node_system
  n5@{ shape: rounded, label: "**check​_​point​_​light​_​mesh​_​visibility**<br/>计算点光与聚光灯阴影可见的网格。" }
  class n5 node_system
  n6@{ shape: rounded, label: "**update​_​spot​_​light​_​frusta**<br/>更新可见聚光灯的阴影视锥。" }
  class n6 node_system
  n7@{ shape: rounded, label: "**extract​_​shadow​_​lod​_​origin**<br/>来自crate:bevy​_​pbr ↗：解析点光与聚光<br/>阴影 LOD 的距离参考位置。" }
  class n7 node_system
  class n7 external_node
  n8@{ shape: rounded, label: "**extract​_​lights**<br/>来自crate:bevy​_​pbr ↗：提取各类可见光<br/>源及阴影渲染状态。" }
  class n8 node_system
  class n8 external_node
  n9@{ shape: rounded, label: "**check​_​dir​_​light​_​mesh​_​visibility**<br/>计算方向光各相机级联可见的投影网格。" }
  class n9 node_system
  n10@{ shape: rounded, label: "**extract​_​clusters​_​for​_​cpu​_​clustering**<br/>来自crate:bevy​_​pbr ↗：把 CPU 聚簇结<br/>果转换为渲染侧对象列表。" }
